    "household_assumptions": "Two medium eggs estimate100g edible portion, explicitly variable. Milk30ml approximates30g rather than official specificgravity1.03; difference is within declared household estimate. Oil3ml assumes0.92g/ml, with2.76g unrounded input and2.8g displayed. Recipe nutrition is explicitly estimated; no exact real-life nutrition claim.",
